WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.074 --> 00:00:03.184
(upbeat jazz music)

00:00:03.184 --> 00:00:04.512
- Hi, so cute!

00:00:04.512 --> 00:00:05.749
- Oh, thank you!

00:00:05.749 --> 00:00:08.738
- Your poor parents must
be so disappointed in you.

00:00:11.688 --> 00:00:13.839
- Are you even old enough to drive?

00:00:13.839 --> 00:00:16.186
- Well, there goes any
chance of fun in your life.

00:00:16.186 --> 00:00:17.574
- Do your parents watch him all the time?

00:00:17.574 --> 00:00:18.570
- Oh, so you're babysitter?

00:00:18.570 --> 00:00:19.989
- Aw, so is he your little brother?

00:00:19.989 --> 00:00:21.498
- Oh my God, you're
just like Gilmore Girls.

00:00:21.498 --> 00:00:23.430
- So, how are you
supposed to have a career?

00:00:23.430 --> 00:00:24.758
- Oh, are you still with the dad?

00:00:24.758 --> 00:00:25.845
- Are you with the mom?

00:00:25.845 --> 00:00:27.535
- Are you getting any
financial assistance?

00:00:27.535 --> 00:00:30.524
- You must hate not being
able to party every weekend.

00:00:30.524 --> 00:00:32.274
- But you're just a baby yourself!

00:00:35.094 --> 00:00:36.319
- Is that really the way you think

00:00:36.319 --> 00:00:37.979
adults are supposed to speak?

00:00:37.979 --> 00:00:40.485
But what do I know, I'm just a kid, right?

00:00:40.485 --> 00:00:42.425
Have a nice day.

